+algorithm.  The generator samples x before forming y=f(x).  Sparse-coordinate,
+copy-output, linear-only, termwise-power, and random-restart attacks are tested;
+none sees the eigenspace decomposition.  Difficulty grows by increasing p while
+the exact witness remains one three-coordinate field element.
+"""
