+        "  f(u) = A_a(u) + A_(a^2)(u) + Tr(u)^s.",
+        f"The parameter satisfies a^(p^2+p+1)=1, a!=1, and gcd(s,p-1)=1.",
+        "Consequently the displayed f has exactly one preimage for every target.",
+        "",
+        f"Find the unique x in K such that f(x)={_elt_text(inst['target'])}.",
