Implemented the self-contained Track B generator based on [arXiv:2407.12688](https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.12688).

Deliverables:

- [Generator module](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2407.12688/gen_2407_12688.py)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2407.12688/selftest_report.json)
- [README](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2407.12688/README.md)
