- [Hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2407.12688/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [Placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2407.12688/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

Local results:

- All G1–G8 and G9 size/effort gates pass.
- Guessing: 0/200,000; exact probability \(1/7{,}189{,}057\).
- Five adversarial attacks: 0/8 successes each.
- Reference scan: 1,526,707 candidates, 44,274,503 operations, 13.878 seconds.
- Answer: 3 atoms, 13 characters.
- Canonical-key tests: 120/120 invariance checks and 20/20 distinct unrelated instances.

The external hardening verdict remains unavailable: the supplied OpenRouter key returned HTTP 403 total-limit errors for every bare, hinted, and placebo attempt. Those script-generated failures are preserved and are not misreported as model failures. Consequently, `hard` is a locally verified shipping candidate, but not yet oracle-certified.
